{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116476","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116476/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116476/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116476/events","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116476","id":3962772770,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc7E3nKf","number":116476,"title":"Fix GDScript signal callback shadowing native class members","user":{"login":"HamidRezaLS","id":144286220,"node_id":"U_kgDOCJmiDA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/144286220?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/HamidRezaLS","html_url":"https://github.com/HamidRezaLS","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HamidRezaLS/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HamidRezaLS/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HamidRezaLS/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HamidRezaLS/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HamidRezaLS/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HamidRezaLS/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HamidRezaLS/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HamidRezaLS/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HamidRezaLS/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","color":"aaccff","default":true,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097162,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTcxNjI=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/discussion","name":"discussion","color":"ccaaff","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098082,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgwODI=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:gdscript","name":"topic:gdscript","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098219,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyMTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:editor","name":"topic:editor","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":4,"created_at":"2026-02-19T12:40:37Z","updated_at":"2026-10-01T16:41:54Z","closed_at":"2026-10-01T16:18:47Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/116476","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116476","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116476.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116476.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"### Summary\r\nFix a problem where the generation of a signal callback (e.g., `value_changed` in `HSlider`) results in argument names that shadow the node's native properties, triggering immediate GDScript warnings.\r\n\r\n### Problem\r\nThe signal callback generator uses the signal's argument names as is.\r\nFor example, `HSlider` (inheriting `Range`) has a signal `value_changed(value: float)`.\r\nThis currently generates:\r\n`func _on_value_changed(value: float):`\r\nHowever, `HSlider` has a property named `value`, so this triggers a shadowing warning.\r\n\r\n### Fix\r\n- Modified `ScriptTextEditor::add_callback` to pass the script's base native type to the function generator (instead of an empty string).\r\n- Modified `GDScriptLanguage::make_function` to check `ClassDB` for property shadowing in the class hierarchy (recursive check).\r\n- If a shadow is detected, the argument name is prefixed with `p_` (e.g., `p_value`).\r\n\r\nFixes #116423\r\n<!--\r\nPlease target the `master` branch in priority.\r\n\r\nRelevant fixes are cherry-picked for stable branches as needed by maintainers.\r\n\r\nTo speed up the contribution process and avoid CI errors, please set up pre-commit hooks locally:\r\nhttps://contributing.godotengine.org/en/latest/engine/guidelines/code_style.html\r\n-->","closed_by":{"login":"HamidRezaLS","id":144286220,"node_id":"U_kgDOCJmiDA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/144286220?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/HamidRezaLS","html_url":"https://github.com/HamidRezaLS","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HamidRezaLS/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HamidRezaLS/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HamidRezaLS/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HamidRezaLS/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HamidRezaLS/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HamidRezaLS/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HamidRezaLS/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HamidRezaLS/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HamidRezaLS/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116476/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116476/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}